### Valid pageview (expect 204)
POST http://localhost:7071/api/pageview
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "path": "/",
  "referrerHost": "google.at",
  "viewportWidth": 1920
}

### Invalid payload (expect 400)
POST http://localhost:7071/api/pageview
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Invalid path, missing leading slash (expect 400)
POST http://localhost:7071/api/pageview
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "path": "no-slash",
  "referrerHost": "google.at",
  "viewportWidth": 1920
}

### Full payload with session and visitor identifiers (expect 204)
POST http://localhost:7071/api/pageview
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "path": "/",
  "referrerHost": "google.at",
  "viewportWidth": 1920,
  "sessionId": "3f2b8c4a-9d1e-4f6b-a7c8-5e0d1b2f3a4c",
  "visitorId": "7c9e6679-7425-40de-944b-e07fc1f90ae7",
  "navigationType": "reload"
}

### Minimal legacy-shaped payload (expect 204)
POST http://localhost:7071/api/pageview
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "path": "/",
  "referrerHost": "google.at",
  "viewportWidth": 1920
}
